{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"我到底在气谁 又在想谁\",\"source\":\"心里明明有东西，却还分不清这份不平静究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿还不确定这份不平静究竟属于哪种情绪，屏幕稿却预设了生气和想念，只把对象留成疑问。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"那一刻的轻松是真的\",\"source\":\"那一刻的轻松可以是真的，并非假装\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把一种可能成立的听法改成了确定判断。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"昂扬退潮后，又忍不住问：刚才是真的相信，还是只在努力相信\",\"source\":\"仿佛心里冒出一句自问：我刚才是真的相信那些话，还是只是在努力让自己相信？\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是用可能浮现的自问来描写音乐，屏幕稿则写成了确实忍不住发问。\"},{\"sec\":\"S05\",\"screen\":\"委屈和火气都在 还想替自己争口气\",\"source\":\"里面可以同时有愤怒、悲伤，也有想维护自己的那股劲\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿提出的是一种可能同时存在的情绪组合，屏幕稿改成这些情绪和动机确定都存在。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"压在心底的委屈和想念终于冒了头\",\"source\":\"那些压住的愿望、委屈和思念，终于有机会浮现\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"把终于有机会浮现改成已经冒头，将可能性写成了确定发生。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "880a77e9-12e9-4bca-958c-e4f83bd74049", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T065843285204Z", "elapsed_seconds": 367.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T07:04:50.700047+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "266d7fcb375d7577e53e99a9809d834e78421c81b9b7b67426a0dc30f8d66a0f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_reque